OL,3,GNEWSASeal given all-clear by vets to
OL,4,Areturn to pool
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seal has been given the all-clear by
OL,7,Fvets to return to his friends in an
OL,8,Fanimal sanctuary following successful
OL,9,Fcataract eye surgery, staff say.
OL,11,FThe Cornish Seal Sanctuary in Gweek,
OL,12,FCornwall, said resident seal Jarvis had
OL,13,Fmade the move back to his home pool
OL,14,Fvery easily and was settling back in
OL,15,Fwell with Bo and Buddy.
OL,17,FJarvis was rescued in 2016 with
OL,18,Fcataracts in both eyes and underwent a
OL,19,Foperation in October from a specialist
OL,20,Feye vet on his right eye.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
