OL,3,GNEWSASeal given all-clear by vets to
OL,4,Areturn to pool
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sanctuary launched a fundraiser for
OL,7,Fcosts to operate on both eyes and give
OL,8,Fhim a chance to see again, and raised
OL,9,Fmore than #15,000. Bosses previously
OL,10,Fsaid they been hoped he might undergo
OL,11,Fsurgery on his left eye in 2027.
